{"package":"Expand-Diff","version":"1.0.4","assessment":"complete","packageSha256":"78f19eac6dca413db1cffc07f6e9b606db2b05335e695505450057f47bb290e1","scannedAt":"2026-10-24T09:33:21.816Z","scannerVersion":"0.1.0","rulesetVersion":"0.1.0","tools":{"powerShell":"7.5.12","psscriptAnalyzer":"1.25.0","psscriptAnalyzerExpected":"1.25.0","clamav":null},"packageUrl":"https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Expand-Diff/1.0.4","metadata":{"title":"Expand-Diff","description":"The script is designed for diff and patch files created by git. It expands\nthe specified diff file into directories \"a\" and \"b\" (original and changes)\nwith pieces of files stored in the diff.\n\nThen you can use your diff tool of choice in order to compare the\ndirectories \"a\" and \"b\", i.e. to visualize the original diff file.\n\nThe following diff lines are recognized and processed:\n\n\t--- a/... | \"a/...\" | /dev/null ~ file \"a\"\n\t+++ b/... | \"b/...\" | /dev/null ~ file \"b\"\n\t@@... ~ chunk header\n\t ... ~ common line\n\t-... ~ \"a\" line\n\t+... ~ \"b\" line\n\nOther lines are ignored.","authors":"Roman Kuzmin","owners":"nightroman","projectUrl":"https://github.com/nightroman/PowerShelf","publishedAt":"2022-02-16T07:03:56.82","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T00:40:01.137","tags":["Git","Diff","Patch","Compare","Merge","PSScript","PSFunction_Write-A","PSCommand_Write-A","PSFunction_Write-B","PSCommand_Write-B","PSFunction_Decode-Path","PSCommand_Decode-Path","PSIncludes_Function"]},"dependencies":[],"fileInventory":[{"path":"_rels/.rels","size":505,"crc32":"dd2bbff4","extension":"rels"},{"path":"Expand-Diff.nuspec","size":1356,"crc32":"2f170a8f","extension":"nuspec"},{"path":"Expand-Diff.ps1","size":4070,"crc32":"eab0d718","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"[Content_Types].xml","size":465,"crc32":"72f893e7","extension":"xml"},{"path":"package/services/metadata/core-properties/b54b8643f8c340168339bcbedf67b4b3.psmdcp","size":1403,"crc32":"eb90a3b4","extension":"psmdcp"}],"findings":[],"coverage":{"